---
import FeedbackWidget from '../components/FeedbackWidget.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Episode 3 lesson">
  <h1>Ship with AI, with confidence</h1>
  <p>
    AI can help us move from an idea to working code quickly. Shipping responsibly still needs
    clear review, security checks, and a repeatable path to production.
  </p>
  <div class="card">
    <strong>Episode 3 takeaway:</strong> Let AI accelerate the work, then use people and
    automation together to confirm that the change is safe to ship.
  </div>
  <p>
    Start with a small change, ask for focused review, and let your pipeline verify the same
    standards every time. That keeps speed useful without making trust an afterthought.
  </p>
  <FeedbackWidget />
</Layout>
